cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PaleobiologyDB.jl: A Julia interface to the Paleobiology Database"
abstract: >-
  PaleobiologyDB.jl is a Julia package for paleobiological informatics and
  analysis. It provides an interface to the Paleobiology Database Web API,
  taxonomy tools, data caching, PhyloPic integration, and Makie-based
  visualization extensions.
